    "title": "Programming Is Fun!",
    "slug": "programming-is-fun",
    "content": "Thought I'd spend my Friday night coining my alias Deveric by christening it with my official portfolio Full Stack site, done with the frontend more stuff coming for the backend <a href=\"https://lnkd.in/djTV-Art\">NextJS13 porfolio</a>  #frontend #backend #nextjs #typescript #seo #vercel",
    "date": "2022-12-30T23:13:19Z",
    "image": "posts/coding.jpg",
    "author": 1,
    "excerpt": "Learning new tech stacks is fun right? Yep - that's what I did one Friday night, exploring the exciting features introduced in NextJS13...",
